I am in that small vegetable shop.
I give the vegetables to the shopkeeper.
He puts it on a small scale.
He weighs the vegetables.
"How much is this?" I ask.
"Two hundred rupees," he says.
I take my purse.
I give him two hundred rupees.
He gives the vegetables to me.
I like fresh vegetables very much.
I carefully pack everything into my bags.
Now the bags are very heavy.
I say thank you to him.
I walk to my house.
